{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-应用、小程序与游戏\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"查询应用包相关信息和包含的分包信息，不受分包新建方式影响。本接口能力覆盖旧接口【查询应用分包列表】，且支持多账户体系，可迁移至本接口获取应用分包列表。配合接口有【获取Access token】、【查询应用信息】。\",\"id\":\"tools.app_management.extend_package.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/app_management/extend_package/list_v2/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1710414490537101\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.app_management.extend_package.list_old\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710745401356\",\"reason\":\"本接口能力覆盖该旧接口，可迁移至本接口获取应用分包列表\",\"relation\":\"旧版替代接口\",\"title\":\"查询应用分包列表\"},{\"id\":\"auth.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要通过该接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"tools.app_management.get_app_info\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/8/docs/1696710742760448\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要通过该接口查询获取应用包ID\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"查询应用信息\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1710414490537101\",\"title\":\"查询安卓应用分包列表 （支持所有账户体系）\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ATnRv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-hyeuKHes%5C%22%3E%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%88%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%AF%A5%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%8C%85%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%92%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-V4rR3t1p%5C%22%3E%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23333333%3B%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%97%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E6%96%B0%E5%BB%BA%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%88%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%81%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93%E5%8F%B7%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%EF%BC%89%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%8C%3Cstrong%3E%E9%83%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%88%B0%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-MmmTHQCh%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%97%A7%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1696710745401356%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%A4%9A%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0-%E6%97%A7%E7%89%88%E5%8F%8A%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8F%B0-%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%88%E3%80%81AD%E3%80%81%E6%98%9F%E5%9B%BE%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%3Cstrong%3E%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB%E8%87%B3%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hyeuKHes\">查询分包列表（支持所有账户体系），可查询该应用包相关信息和包含的分包信息。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-V4rR3t1p\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">不受分包新建方式（系统自动、手动上传渠道号分包）影响，<strong>都可以获取到</strong></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MmmTHQCh\">本接口能力覆盖旧接口<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710745401356\" target=\"_blank\">查询应用分包列表</a>，且支持多账户体系（巨量引擎工作台-旧版及巨量引擎工作台-升级版、AD、星图），<strong>因此可迁移至本接口获取应用分包列表</strong></p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201741281207399567%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-agFdT8H7\" id=\"h346b9f0-agFdT8H7\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-LRLzfAmy\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/app_management/extend_package/list_v2/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/app_management/extend_package/list_v2/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1710414490537101\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-D7PLWc7U\" id=\"h346b9f0-D7PLWc7U\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-QWgiP1vR\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hPmQG0jF\" id=\"h346b9f0-hPmQG0jF\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RUyj7HvW\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-DTRdZ2Rj\" id=\"h346b9f0-DTRdZ2Rj\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 233px;\" width=\"233\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fuochHmj\">账户ID，account_type对应的账户ID（近期升级到巨量引擎工作台-升级版的客户请传入应用包所属旧版巨量引擎工作台/子旧版巨量引擎工作台ID，账户类型传入旧版巨量引擎工作台）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ntUVeW6c\">账户类型，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-kcmZ5ciA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4Pj5N1mc\"><code>AD</code> 投放账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ca8UalFH\"><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台</code> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">巨量引擎工作台-升级版/旧版</span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BGWBfJSh\"><code>STAR</code>星图</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">package_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZDdwTbAX\">应用包ID，可通过「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/8/docs/1696710742760448\" target=\"_blank\">查询应用信息</a>」接口查询获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CE1joGbY\">页码，默认值为<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gYkbUPdI\">页面大小，默认值为<code>10</code>，最大不超过<code>100</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-I0B4qvFU\">过滤条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2aXmlnKC\">分包状态，可选值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-b8RjagYP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-61dT4lLm\"><code>ALL</code> 所有状态</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PUQXDJ3U\"><code>NOT_UPDATE</code> 未更新</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NjeJOBJF\"><code>CREATING</code> 创建中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4fFBh5B1\"><code>UPDATING</code> 更新中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Le0ZERaI\"><code>ENABLE</code> 已发布<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">（默认值）</span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0E6mmhqE\"><code>CREATION_FAILED</code> 创建失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-joP56aUH\"><code>UPDATE_FAILED</code> 更新失败</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-epExonkv\"> </p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">channel_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-e8NI31jg\">渠道号，可通过渠道号筛选应用分包，单次支持传入渠道号个数&lt;=50</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-